    "description": {
      "content": "The Cursor Admin API allows team and enterprise administrators to programmatically manage members, billing groups, audit logs, daily usage data, spending, repository indexing blocklists, and per-user spend limits for their Cursor team. Authentication uses HTTP Basic Authentication with the API key as the username and an empty password.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Cursor Support",
